#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:5
msgid "Text settings"
msgstr "文本设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:7
msgid ""
"Before starting to work, QElectroTech allows defining the default appearance"
" of the different texts."
msgstr "在开始工作之前，QElectroTech允许定义不同文本的默认外观。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:10
msgid "Elements texts"
msgstr "要点案文"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:13
msgid "Independent texts"
msgstr "独立案文"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:15
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining a default orientation and text font from the "
"text field object."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许从文本字段对象定义默认方向和文本字体。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:17
#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:34
#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:41
msgid ""
"Click at the button from the text font to display the `select font PopUp "
"window`_."
msgstr "点击文字字体的按钮显示 `选择字体 PopUp 窗口 <select font PopUp window_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:18
msgid "Select a default rotation angle for the text."
msgstr "选择文本的默认旋转角度。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:22
msgid ""
"Opposite to the geometrical angle, QElectroTech use the clock direction to "
"define angles."
msgstr "相对于几何角度，QEelectroTech使用时钟方向来定义角度。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:27
#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:46
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech dynamic texts settings"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 动态文本设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:30
msgid "Summary pages"
msgstr "页次"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:32
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining a default text font from the project summary "
"table."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许从项目总表中定义默认文本字体。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:37
msgid "Other texts"
msgstr "其他案文"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/settings_text.rst:39
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining a default orientation and text font for the "
"text that is not part from an element, text field object and from the "
"project summary."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许定义一个不来自元素，文本字段对象和项目摘要的文本的默认方向和文本字体。"
